  .job-card
    h3 Sagawa Express
    p This is a corporate delivery job in Minato Ward. You will deliver an average of 120 to 150 packages per day. Shifts can be adjusted, and introductions to other areas are available. Work starts from November to December.
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Unit Price:
          | 140 yen / per package (18,000 yen per day for 120 deliveries)
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Position:
          | Light Cargo Driver
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Working Hours:
          | 08:00~18:00 (up to 19:00)
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Holidays:
          | Shift-based
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Contract Type:
          | Outsourcing contract
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Location:
          | All areas OK
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Interview:
          | In-person (Online available)
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Payment Terms:
          | End of month closing, payment at the end of the following month
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Available Visas:
          | Any visa that allows you to work as a driver. Up to 28 hours per week is also acceptable.
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Required License:
          | Regular driver's license
    .row 
      .col-sm-6
        p
          strong Other:
          | Gasoline and vehicle costs will be deducted from your salary
  


